    "faq": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<strong>Product description</strong>",
            "text": "<p>Soothe neck tension with our ergonomic massage pillow. Gentle massage and warmth ease fatigue perfectly for busy lives.<br/><br/>Why it works:<br/>Relieves neck stiffness<br/>Soothes soreness from work and driving<br/>Reduces stress and boosts sleep<br/>Warmth relaxes tight muscles<br/><br/>How to enjoy:<br/>Place it under your neck, adjust strength, and use daily for 10–15 minutes.<br/><br/>Quality you can trust:<br/>Fully safety tested and refined by user feedback. 180-day full refund for risk-free use.<br/><br/>Bonus:<br/>Flexible subscriptions plus free delivery on your first order.<br/><br/>Your daily solution for comfortable, pain-free necks.<br/><br/><br/><br/></p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<strong>Who's it for</strong>",
            "text": "<p><br/>Perfect for anyone stuck sitting all day with sore necks, frequent phone users, long-distance drivers and those troubled by chronic cervical discomfort. Whether you’re working from home, commuting or traveling, it brings cozy neck relief whenever you need it.<br/><br/></p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question-3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<strong>Benefits</strong>",
            "text": "<p><br/>You can enjoy soothing neck massages anytime right at home instead of scheduling salon visits. It fits snugly around your neck to relieve daily strain and bad posture effortlessly. Lightweight enough for the office, car and trips, its easy-to-clean surface keeps it fresh for regular use. Gentle warmth and massage tension calm stiff muscles, easing discomfort and helping you fall asleep more comfortably.<br/><br/><br/></p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question-4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<strong>Why trust us</strong>",
            "text": "<p><br/>We craft ergonomic neck massagers tailored to busy daily life. All items undergo strict safety testing for EMS, heat and silicone quality.<br/>Optimized via mass user feedback, plus transparent support and a 180-day risk-free refund policy for worry-free purchase.<br/><br/></p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question-5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<strong>Shipping & Returns</strong>",
            "text": "<p><br/>Your neck massager will be delivered right to your door. Enjoy flexible subscriptions you can modify anytime. If you aren’t satisfied, our 180-day full refund promise lets you shop risk-free.<br/><br/></p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "contact": {
          "type": "contact",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Didn’t find your answer?",
